Purpose: Add a deeply researched Forward Deployed Engineering mission in the
  background, integrated with every applicable mission surface. Preserve existing
  progress, focus choices, frozen curricula and the complete Discovery Atlas.

Tasks:
  [x] Review primary employer roles and technical/customer-delivery sources.
  [x] Trace mission identity, stored state, journal replay, learning and graph boundaries.
  [x] Author a progressive, cited curriculum with meaningful artifacts and diagnostics.
  [x] Add background defaults and strictly compatible old-workspace normalization.
  [x] Integrate mission views, roadmap/library/search, colors and graph relationships.
  [x] Support evidence, planning, recall, activity and source-derived Atlas recognition.
